exclusion of renal injury from primary renal dysfunction or high-pressure bladder outflow
obstruction.
Urinary tract ultrasound - assessment of prostate volume, bladder wall and residual urine and
exclusion of hydronephrosis
Prostate specific antigen to exclude prostate cancer - most guidelines recommend the use of
serum PSA only if prostate cancer diagnosis will influence management or if the test will
assist in decision making
