Christina, 38 years old, presents for discussion
about her risk of developing ovarian cancer. Her
detailed history shows that she is the mother of
four children, all breastfed. She used oral
contraceptive pills for five years after the birth of
her last child. Two years ago, she underwent a
hysterectomy to ‘get rid of OCPs.’ Apart from a BMI
of 31, she is otherwise healthy on examination.
